<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent rated hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lucent rated hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it initiated coverage of Lucent Technologies Inc with short- and long-term hold recommendations.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Chandan Sarkar established Lucent earnings estimates of $2.07 per share for fiscal 1997 and $2.46 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- Lucent shares were off 1/4 to 53-7/8 in morning trade.</p>
</text>
